 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "## Validity of the global blow-up gluing datum\n\nThe raw datum $\\mathsf G(X,\\mathcal I,(V_i))$ has isomorphism-valued\noverlap maps satisfying the identity, symmetry, and triple-overlap cocycle\naxioms; hence it is a scheme gluing datum.",
   "uses": [],
   "elementary": null
  },
  {
   "text": "*Proof.*\nThe overlap maps are isomorphisms by\n[lemma-nagata-global-blowup-overlap-basic]; independence of refinements,\nidentity, symmetry, and the triple cocycle are given by the cited coherence\nlemmas. Hence the hypotheses of\n`AlgebraicGeometry.Scheme.GlueData.glued` are satisfied.",
   "uses": [
    "lemma-nagata-global-blowup-overlap-basic"
   ],
   "elementary": false
  }
 ],
